# POLLY, Notes and the Bass rule (xpose.c: a Bass-type instrument's first note after a chord change plays the root).
# A pitch edit the rule would hide (BA's downbeat C2 to F2, P1 changing chord every bar) asks once a groove whether
# the bass should play as written (Type Chord 1): no keeps the rule (the readout says so), yes switches, undo puts it
# back; not asked again for that groove.
wait 300
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
tap PLAY
wait 2000
tap SEQ
turn ALGO -1
expect track 4
tap SEQ
expect page 17
expect slot1_trk4_xtype 4
expect notes_where_is_BA|bar_1.1|C2 1
# ---- C2 to F2: the question; HOME: no, the rule stays and the readout says it
spin K2 5
expect slot1_trk4_note0 41
expect asking 1
wait 300
shot bass_ask.png
tap HOME
expect asking 0
expect slot1_trk4_xtype 4
expect notes_where_is_BA|bar_1.1|F2,_heard_as_the_root 1
wait 300
shot bass_root.png
# ---- asked once a groove: another edit there, no question
spin K2 2
expect slot1_trk4_note0 43
expect asking 0
